Z||000001||Urchin||08-27-2001||12:58 PM||||Personally I think it depends on the rims you have.  If you have the factory rims like in the upper corner of this page I would say go black (I love black w/ those rims)  If they are after market, dpending on the style I'd probably go with red or the gun metal grey would be good too.  What about blue/black?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
