Z||000009||Brandon86SE||08-27-2001||08:39 PM||||Voytek - You have to bring that up all the time don't you?  :-)<P>It's true though, whenever we're out on a run, or at a club meet or whatever, Voytek's yellow is the one that turns heads.  It's funny, there'll be a big line of Fiero's, and he'll be in the middle somewhere, and people sometimes don't even notice the first few, and stand and point at his.  Must be nice to have the only yellow with blue stripes in town.  The longer I live here, the more gold ones I see.  (even though that is only like 3-4)<P>And, on an unrelated note, how was Vegas Voytek?||||reg||1
